BT /F2 8.5 Tf 65.00 473.00 Td (1. Cell-by-Cell Differential Comparison:) Tj ET
0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
BT /F4 8 Tf 65.00 459.00 Td (   Dirty_Condition\(r, c\) = \(Back_Buffer[r][c] != Front_Buffer[r][c]\) OR Force_Redraw) Tj ET
0.063 0.725 0.506 rg
BT /F1 8 Tf 65.00 447.00 Td (   If Dirty_Condition == FALSE: Character is skipped. Physical bus output = 0 bytes.) Tj ET
0.059 0.090 0.165 rg
