0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
BT /F1 8 Tf 65.00 413.00 Td (   Given row r and span start col c_start, identify maximal contiguous dirty length L:) Tj ET
0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
BT /F4 7.8 Tf 65.00 401.00 Td (   L = max { k in [1, 20 - c_start] : ALL\(Dirty_Condition\(r, c_start + i\)\) for i in [0, k-1] }) Tj ET
0.055 0.455 0.565 rg
BT /F1 8 Tf 65.00 389.00 Td (   Hardware Operation: Emit single setCursor\(c_start, r\), then stream L characters consecutively.) Tj ET
0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
BT /F4 7.8 Tf 65.00 377.00 Td (   Front_Buffer[r][c_start ... c_start + L - 1] = Back_Buffer[r][c_start ... c_start + L - 1]) Tj ET
0.059 0.090 0.165 rg
