0.063 0.725 0.506 rg
BT /F4 8 Tf 65.00 343.00 Td (   Bytes_Saved = Bytes_Naive\(340\) - [ \(L_written * 4\) + \(N_spans * 4\) ] >= 308 Bytes/frame) Tj ET
