BT /F1 8 Tf 65.00 437.00 Td (   The decay time of the director orientation theta\(t\) is governed by the rotational viscosity gamma1:) Tj ET
0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
BT /F4 8 Tf 65.00 425.00 Td (   t_decay = \(gamma1 * d^2\) / \(pi^2 * K_effective\)   where d is cell gap \(5 to 8 um\).) Tj ET
0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
BT /F1 8 Tf 65.00 413.00 Td (   At 25 deg C, t_decay is 120ms to 180ms. Refreshing at 50ms \(20 Hz\) violates the physical) Tj ET
0.937 0.267 0.267 rg
BT /F1 8 Tf 65.00 403.00 Td (   relaxation envelope, modulating contrast by >40% and creating illegible smeared digits.) Tj ET
0.059 0.090 0.165 rg
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 65.00 385.00 Td (2. Human Visual Integration & Cognitive Bandwidth:) Tj ET
0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
BT /F1 8 Tf 65.00 373.00 Td (   While direct light sources exhibit a flicker fusion threshold around 60 Hz, passive reflective LCDs) Tj ET
0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
BT /F1 8 Tf 65.00 363.00 Td (   modulate ambient light. For alphanumeric information reading \(ISO 9241 Ergonomics standard\),) Tj ET
0.200 0.255 0.333 rg
BT /F1 8 Tf 65.00 353.00 Td (   eye-tracking fixation requires >= 200ms per visual chunk. An update interval of 100ms provides) Tj ET
0.063 0.725 0.506 rg
BT /F2 8 Tf 65.00 343.00 Td (   immediate physical responsiveness to transients while preventing cognitive display jitter.) Tj ET
0.055 0.455 0.565 rg
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 65.00 323.00 Td (3. Bus Load Harmonization: 100ms interval limits I2C bus traffic to 1.85 KB/s \(<1.5% bus load\).) Tj ET
